      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-7",
      "term": "计算图",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "深度学习计算可表示为由可微函数节点构成的有向无环图。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 26
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-8",
      "term": "矩阵链式法则",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "复合向量函数的 Jacobian 按依赖顺序相乘；矩阵形状提供重要的正确性检查。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 34
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial u}\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 34
          }
        },
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-9",
      "term": "反向传播",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "反向传播从损失端逆向传递共享导数项，避免为每个参数重复计算整条链。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 36
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-10",
      "term": "通用层反向规则",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "输出侧梯度与层对输入、参数的局部 Jacobian 相乘，得到输入侧梯度和参数梯度。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 41
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "g_{in}=g_{out}L^x,\\quad \\partial J/\\partial\\theta=g_{out}L^\\theta",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 41
          }
        },
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-11",
      "term": "批量梯度",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "平均损失的梯度等于各数据点损失梯度的平均。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 45
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial\\theta}=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\frac{\\partial J_i(x^i,\\theta)}{\\partial\\theta}",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 45
          }
        },
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-12",
      "term": "线性层",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "在讲义的行向量梯度约定下，线性层把输出梯度乘以权重矩阵以传回输入。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
