            "value": 55
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "common_misconceptions": [
    {
      "misconception": "反向传播就是梯度下降。",
      "correction": "反向传播计算梯度；参数更新是随后独立的一步。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 42
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "所有节点都必须处处光滑。",
      "correction": "讲义的 ReLU 在零点不光滑，但仍用于可微计算图。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 24
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "分支处选一条路径即可。",
      "correction": "所有下游路径对共享上游变量的梯度贡献必须相加。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 53
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "反向传播只能对权重求导。",
      "correction": "也可对输入或图中其他变量相对于标量代价求导。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 61
          }
        },
